en.body:
To the Privacy / Data Protection team at {broker},

I am a Colorado resident requesting deletion of my personal data and opting out of the sale of my personal data under the Colorado Privacy Act, where applicable.

{scope}

{property_note}

Please identify and delete records associated with the following identifiers, subject to applicable legal exceptions:

{identifiers}

I request that you:
1. Delete personal data concerning me that is subject to my deletion rights under the CPA.
2. Stop selling my personal data and processing it for targeted advertising where my opt-out rights apply.
3. Apply this request across applicable affiliated properties and processors, as required by law.
4. Confirm completion in writing, or explain any applicable exceptions or reasons for denial.

{law}

If reasonable identity verification is required, please explain what information is necessary. Please avoid requesting unnecessary sensitive information.

{reference}

Thank you.

Sincerely,
{full_name}
